                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-temp-control",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Understanding Trailer Temperature Control Systems",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "temp-control"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-temp-control-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The best refrigerated trailer systems give operators flexibility and peace of mind. Whether hauling frozen seafood or pharmaceuticals, temperature control is more than just a setting; it's a safeguard for your business reputation.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-temp-control-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Today's reefer trailers feature advanced control panels that automatically adjust cooling cycles, defrost modes, and humidity levels. Paired with real-time telematics, these systems let fleet managers track performance from anywhere, ensuring every load stays within compliance.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-temp-control-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State Trailers, we carry Hyundai Translead refrigerated trailers engineered for energy efficiency, durability, and long-term performance. These units combine high-grade insulation with precision-built refrigeration systems that meet modern hauling standards, ideal for fleets looking to balance performance and cost.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-choosing",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing the Right Reefer Trailer for Your Fleet",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "choosing"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-choosing-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not all refrigerated trailers are built the same. Before purchasing, consider:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-choosing-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "type",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Trailer Size and Capacity",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Match your trailer to your cargo type and route."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Cooling Power",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Evaluate whether your operation needs a deep freeze (-20°F) or a moderate chill."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Fuel Type",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Choose between diesel-powered or electric reefer units depending on trip length."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Maintenance Support",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Work with a dealership that offers on-site parts and service."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-choosing-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your reefer trailer should be a partner in your business success, efficient, dependable, and built for the long haul.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-sunstate",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Fleet Owners Trust Sun State Trailers",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-sunstate"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "As a family-owned Florida dealership, Sun State Trailers understands that your equipment isn't just a purchase; it's your livelihood. Our team works directly with fleet owners and owner-operators, providing the tools and support needed to keep businesses on the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you're buying new, used, or renting, our goal is to simplify the process. We take pride in offering dependable, straightforward service and top-tier equipment that's built to last. From reefer trailers to dry vans, our inventory is backed by knowledgeable staff and on-site service centers designed to keep your fleet moving forward.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When your livelihood depends on keeping cargo cold, you need a partner who understands the job. <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a> provides fleets across Florida with refrigerated trailers that combine performance, reliability, and support. Whether you're in the market for a new, used, or rental reefer trailer, we'll help you find the right fit for your routes, your cargo, and your budget.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
